# Files nobody edits by hand (TOOL-5). check-protected refuses agent edits to them and
# GitHub folds the diffs of those marked linguist-*; the command that owns each one still
# rewrites it. A family kind's mirror, configs/<group>/<kind>.yaml, is marked by its
# `# Generated by` line. The answers file stays unfolded: a pull request that changes
# `_src_path` changes which template the next update runs.
configs/defaults/** linguist-generated protected=generated
.copier-answers.yml protected=generated
notebooks/reference/** linguist-vendored protected=published
